  "display_title": "The Secretary Ran Away",
  "description": "How do you get over a guy you've been in love with forever? Yun Sehee decides the answer is asking him to date her, even if it's just for three months. The only problem? The guy is the cold, confident Kang Taewook, Sehee's boss! Unwilling to lose his top secretary, Taewook agrees to Sehee's unorthodox offer—with a plan to show her just how unlovable he is. Can Taewook make Sehee realize he isn't such a good catch? Or will he find himself falling for a girl who just wants to give him up for good?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
